[en.IDEA_ALL_MAGICTRON_THEORY]
Magictron Theory

[en.IDEA_ALL_MAGICTRON_THEORY_desc]
This country has mastered the theory of magictron and understands the underlying nature of magic: the potential energy of magictron does work to affect the material state of the real world and the material itself.

[zh.IDEA_ALL_MAGICTRON_THEORY]
魔法子理论

[zh.IDEA_ALL_MAGICTRON_THEORY_desc]
这个国家掌握了魔法子理论，了解了魔法的底层本质：魔法子的势能做功影响现实世界的物质状态和物质本身。
